  id: Zapaulo
  displayName: Zapaulo
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fb0d8c6d05230374daba1f1e685ece33, type: 3}
  sortOrder: 1
  includeInDemo: 1
  unlockCost: 5
  prefab: {fileID: 5277714748452175156, guid: 6f2e15fda34922e4d88264352338b398, type: 3}
  selectArtwork: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d3d7ef3adf3678540b3d328a29d8d98e, type: 3}
  menuArt: {fileID: 0}
  bio: Zapaulo is a femboy blue anthropomorphic cat from the White Shard of the HEX
    Mirror Universe, known for his incredible running speed, impressive endurance,
    and determination. He holds the in-universe record for the longest distance ever
    run without stopping, covering an astonishing 1,170 kilometers at a velocity
    of 90 km/h. However, even someone as extraordinarily fast as Zapaulo can get
    into trouble! During his record-breaking journey, he stopped at the Volcanic
    Dessert and ended up getting lost in its dangerous, unforgiving landscape. Stranded
    far from civilization, he survived by hunting Smoke Hounds for sustenance, relying
    on his athletic abilities and survival instincts to endure the harsh environment.
    It took him two whole weeks to finally find his way out, turning what began as
    an incredible athletic achievement into an unexpected survival adventure. Despite
    the ordeal, Zapaulo's legendary run remains a remarkable feat in the HEX Mirror
    Universe, proving that his speed and endurance are matched only by his ability
    to persevere when things go terribly wrong.
  profile:
    speed: 5
    jump: 5
    size: 3
    weight: 1
  stats:
    runSpeed: 7
    superRunSpeed: 15
    jumpHeight: 15
    superJumpHeight: 15
    dashSpeedMultiplier: 2
    punchSpeedReduction: 4
    uppercutSpeedReduction: 2
    maxStamina: 130
  moveset:
  - moveName: Run
    input: A / D or Left / Right
    description: Run along the road.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - moveName: Jump
    input: Space, W or Up
    description: Jump.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - moveName: Punch
    input: Z
    description: Punch enemies, walls and signs in front of you.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - moveName: Uppercut
    input: X
    description: Upward strike.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - moveName: Platform Grasp
    input: C
    description: Immediately jumps on the nearest platofrm. Drains 70 stamina per
      second
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - moveName: Agressive Scratching
    input: Hold Shift
    description: Hold to attack in all direction at the same time. Drains 20 stamina
      per second
    icon: {fileID: 0}
